# Round-6 §3C — Forbidden-tokens allowlist.
#
# One regex per line. Lines starting with # are comments. A match
# on the *literal token* (not the surrounding line) is suppressed.
# Empty file = zero suppressions.
#
# Add an entry only when the matched token is genuinely correct
# (e.g., a country / state code chip that legitimately renders ALL
# CAPS, or a documented acronym that humaniseEnum already preserves).
# Do NOT use this file to silence devnote-style leaks.
